# Allowlist: the build context is only what the wheel build needs.
# Everything else (.git, venvs, build/dist, docs, caches, IDE files, ...)
# stays out by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.rst
!LICENSE
!ecsjobs/

# never ship caches/bytecode from inside the package dir
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
